      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hey, Mr. Bandit, or well, Ser Sunika?\r\nHe said they set up a cage in the cave.",
        "Jp" : "ねぇ、盗賊さん――スニーカーさんだっけ\r\nあの人が洞窟に檻を仕掛けてきたんだって――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 640947,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They were assigned as the 'fish\r\ncatcher' by the bandit leader,\r\nso they placed a cage in a\r\ndamp cave nearby...",
        "Jp" : "盗賊の親分さんに\"魚を獲ってくる係\"に任命されたから、身近で水気のある洞窟に檻を置いたらしいの――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675835,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You can't even catch fish in a cave, so what are\r\nthey doing there!? Plus, they said they got scared\r\nwhen setting the trap, so they can't even go back\r\nto retrieve it!",
        "Jp" : "洞窟で魚は獲れないのに、何してるんだろうね！？\r\nしかも、檻を仕掛ける時に怖い思いをしたから\r\n檻の回収にも行けないんだって！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675836,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, I was asked to procure some fish\r\nand retrieve the cage from the cave.",
        "Jp" : "――というわけで、魚の調達と\r\n洞窟にある檻の回収を頼まれちゃったよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675837,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I agreed to this expecting it to be like Piremoth,\r\njust delivering stuff like berries and mushrooms—\r\nand look what happened!",
        "Jp" : "ピレモスの時みたいに\r\n木の実やキノコなんかを届けるつもりで\r\n引き受けたのにー！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675838,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
